      "note": "Read 2026-11-17 through a summarizing fetch. 'Pressure is defined as the force divided by the area perpendicular to the force over which the force is applied', P = F/A, in pascals (1 Pa = 1 N/m2); 'A given force can have a significantly different effect depending on the area over which the force is exerted'."
    },
