    "handover": [
      "Contact areas from the mat: foam 10 cm thick, 410 cm2; gel 5 cm, 690 cm2; air-cell 8 cm, 1,020 cm2.",
      "Use g = 9.8 m/s2; about 75% of the manikin's weight rests on the seat."
    ],
    "howItWorks": [
      "Pick a step from the action list: look, change, check or ship. Nothing you pick is typed or executed: every step shows an authored result.",
      "Each step takes working minutes, and the clock moves by the minutes it takes. The deadline runs on the same clock.",
      "Shipping is final for this case. Afterwards you record what you found and explain your reasoning."
    ]
